        "enabled_value": true,
        "disabled_value": false
      },
      "notes": "NVIDIA NIM uses chat_template_kwargs.enable_thinking for documented thinking models. enabled_value and disabled_value send JSON booleans directly because reasoning is enabled by default for some NVIDIA models. Model-specific controls such as reasoning_effort, thinking_token_budget, and low_effort are not assumed universally. Ref: docs.nvidia.com/nim."
